5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hi everyone! I’m really excited to help pick the best expansion. I just worry about plans falling apart when things get unpredictable.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Yumi, your caution is noted. I worry we’re ignoring past data. Let’s not reinvent the wheel based on vibes.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I observe your reliance on sentiment. Data is objective. I will verify the actual skill sets on our roster before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,I agree with Benjamin. We must examine the structural funding first. I will review the county grant terms and the endowment.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m a bit nervous, but I think we should check the bus links in the two outer wards first.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I hear you! But I think we need to see if our past outreach actually worked. I’ll check the attendance sheets from former stops.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, attendance sheets are a start, but they don’t explain *why* those stops failed. I’ll check the two programmes begun six years ago.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,I will examine the volunteer register and supervision training. We must confirm who actually possesses the required competencies before assigning new duties.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will also review the running and equipment lines from last year. We need to understand our baseline costs before projecting future needs.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll look into the winter road closures north of the river. It affects who can reach us.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, that’s a great point! I’m glad we’re checking the roads. I’ll look into the bus links in the outer wards too.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Daisuke, road closures are a logistical headache, not a strategic failure. I’ll examine the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use to see actual demand patterns.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I will review the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. External partnerships require verified credentials, not assumptions.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will examine the volunteer register and supervision training. We must verify our current capacity before adding new responsibilities.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry, I didn’t mean to overlap. I’ll just stick to the winter closures for now.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I’m all set! I’ll check the attendance sheets and the bus links. Let’s see what the data says!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll review the two programmes begun six years ago and the evening room bookings. Let’s see what the records actually say.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shion,,I will review the volunteer register and the neighbourhood associations. Competence is not assumed; it is verified.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will review the county grant terms and the running and equipment lines. We must understand the funding structure and baseline costs before proceeding.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll check the winter road closures and the bus links. I just want to see who can actually get here.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
