35,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, the bus links are gone! Residents face an hour’s trip. @Benjamin, the old outreach spots actually drew more people than the main building!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, interesting. But my findings show evening demand peaks after we lock up. We’re missing a clear window.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shion,,"@Minako, your funding review is irrelevant if no one can supervise the new staff. The technician retired; the roster is empty.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, the funding structure is critical. The grant covers only twelve months, then the flat budget absorbs the cost. We must plan for that transition.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Yumi, that hour trip is really hard. @Benjamin, if evenings are peak, maybe we can adjust hours?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, that’s a huge gap! If we can’t reach them, the expansion fails. @Daisuke, maybe mobile units?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, mobile units are a logistical band-aid. The real issue is that we ignore the six-year-old digitisation failure. We need to fix the process, not just the transport.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, process is irrelevant without personnel. The roster lacks supervisors. We cannot assign duties to ghosts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, personnel is vital, but the vehicle overrun proves our baseline is unstable. We cannot absorb new costs if the foundation is already leaking.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, I worry about the people stuck in those outer wards. If we can’t reach them, the expansion feels empty.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Daisuke, I agree! But @Benjamin, fixing the process won’t help if people can’t get here. We need both!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, you’re conflating access with execution. The digitisation failure proves we lack the internal discipline to finish what we start, regardless of transport.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, discipline is a luxury. I have verified the roster. We lack the certified supervisors to execute your ""process.""","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Shion, I hear your concern. But without stable funding, we cannot hire the supervisors you need. The grant’s twelve-month limit is the immediate constraint we must address.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Minako, I understand the funding worry. But if the roads close, no money helps. I just want to make sure no one is left behind.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, I hear you, but I worry about relying on conditions we can’t control. Let’s find a plan that works even when things get unpredictable!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"@Yumi, unpredictability is just poor planning. The records show we failed to index half the images. We must fix that internal rot before adding new variables.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shion,,"@Benjamin, your ""rot"" is a symptom. The cause is the absence of verified skills. I will not fund a process that lacks the human capacity to execute it.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Minako,,"@Benjamin, the vehicle overrun confirms the baseline is unstable. We cannot absorb new costs if the foundation is already leaking.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I’m sorry, I’m getting a bit overwhelmed. I just keep thinking about those residents. Is there really no way to help them?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
